{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38928","headline":"献钱塘县罗着作判官 · 杜荀鹤","name":"献钱塘县罗着作判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还乡夫子遇贤侯，抚字情知不自由。\n莫把一名专懊恼，放教双眼绝冤讐。\n猩袍懒着辞公宴，鹤氅闲披访道流。\n犹有九华知己在，羡君高卧早回头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}